# Device will: remint a lease on keep-operating, elect an operator
# on the Elect clock, destroy keys if there is no heir.
# Capture is a destroy path the owner wrote while alive, not a timer.

will radio-1-will for object radio-1
written-by alice
cancelable-by alice
keep-operating circle operators
remint issuers station-alpha station-beta
elect circle operators clock elect notify alice wait cancel
destroy if-no-heir keys
